# Documentation guide

Format for new `docs/business/*.md` files: Purpose → Business Rules → Workflow → Data → Source of Truth → Edge Cases → Related Files → Common Mistakes → Verification.

Rules:

- Document **behavior and constraints**, not code dumps.
- Record **source of truth** when logic exists in multiple places (wizard vs Filament resource vs presenter).
- Use `[NEEDS_VERIFICATION]` when not confirmed in code/tests.
- Update `docs/README.md` index and Source of Truth table when adding domains.
- Keep `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` short — link to `docs/`, do not duplicate business docs.

Agent workflow: `docs/AGENT_GUIDE.md`.
